  "description": "Optional read-write external data-plane API add-on for Orleans.Lattice. Exposes a transport-agnostic facade (and, via a sibling binding, a gRPC surface) that lets non-.NET clients set, delete, bulk-upsert, atomically batch (single-tree and cross-tree), point-read, bounded-range-read, and bounded-range-delete tree entries, and drive the typed CRDT verbs (counters, sets, flags, registers, sequences, maps, and version vectors). Every operation routes through the gated ILattice grain surface, so the authorization wired into the cluster fires automatically once the caller identity flows. Opt-in and absent by default; registered with a single AddLatticeDataApi(...) call.",
  "id": "Orleans.Lattice.Api.Data",
